# Build
build/
dist/
*.o
*.iconset/

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Private data
# Strings the packaging script must keep out of a release. Local to this
# machine: publishing the list would leak what it exists to protect.
tools/forbidden.local.txt

# Markdown documents: they stay local, outside the repository.
# One is kept for people arriving from outside: README.md, the official
# documentation of the public project. The rules for contributing are in
# CONTRIBUTING.txt. Everything else, working context included, stays on disk.
*.md
!README.md

# Cache di Python: si rigenera a ogni build, non descrive il progetto.
# Nel repository del sito era finita tracciata, ed erano 48 KB di binario che
# cambiavano a ogni esecuzione senza dire niente a nessuno.
tools/__pycache__/
*.pyc
